1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,850
Send passages and figures from the viewer
to a board.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:11,625
Select a sentence, choose the arrow button,
add a comment, choose a board, and send.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,725
For a figure, use the clipping feature
to make a clean crop.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,825
Select the clip's Send button, choose
the same board, and send again.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:30,825
Both items wait in staging.
Drag each one onto the canvas.

6
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:39,175
Each card keeps a backlink. Open one to return
to its source in the paper. Enjoy Papol.
